A retry happens inside the same turn, once [1].

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Answerer
  participant L as llmwire
  loop until delivered
    A->>L: stream
    alt nothing delivered
      L-->>A: error
    else delivered
      L-->>A: tokens
    end
  end
```

A stream that delivered is never retried [1].
